      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Each chat has a Permissions menu in the message box, set to Auto by default, with Bypass permissions as an option. A reply's working steps now fold into one line you can open.</p>]]></description>
