      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The assistant can make and rename Spaces, projects and folders. Chats follow new messages unless you've scrolled well up. The conversation is easier to read, with tinted bubbles for your messages and quieter tool steps.</p>]]></description>
