      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Fixes a Mac losing touch with the brain after a network drop while still showing as linked. It now notices within about a minute and reconnects.</p>]]></description>
